# NPC skaters react to the player's combo. The thresholds are lowered here (cheer and copy at 500
# points, copy every time) so the Big 3 kickflip (Kickflip + BIG 3 GAP, 700) counts as big. NPC 3,
# rolling out of its own Big 3 send right by the landing, stomps its board (npcCheer) and rides the
# player's line after them (npcCopy): from where the player got moving, at the player's speeds,
# popping where the player popped, with a grab of its own (Indy) over the set (a Pop Shove-It while the
# feel pass's park carve moved the NPCs' draws, until their corners took the park carve's numbers too). The player's run is
# exactly the same as without them (soma-npcs-player).
park soma
cmd 0 npc spawn 6
cmd 0 setData npc.cheer.points 500
cmd 0 setData npc.copy.points 500
cmd 0 setData npc.copy.chance 1
spawn big3
hold up 0..100
hold ollie 166..196
tap flip+left 202
run 1400
expect event comboLanded{name=Kickflip + BIG 3 GAP,multiplier=2} within 336..340
expect event npcCheer{id=3} within 336..340
expect event npcCheer count == 1
expect event npcCopy{id=3} within 336..340
expect event npcTrick{id=3,trick=Indy} within 579..583
expect event npcCombo{id=3,name=Indy} within 660..664
expect no event bail
